<view class="page"><view class="card"><view class="muted">发卡会员</view><view class="row member"><b>{{member.nickname}}</b><text>{{member.phone}}</text></view></view><view class="section-title">卡商品</view><picker range="{{products}}" range-key="name" value="{{productIndex}}" bindchange="productChange"><view class="field row"><text>{{products[productIndex].name}}</text><text>¥{{products[productIndex].currentPrice}} ›</text></view></picker><view class="section-title">实收现金金额</view><input class="field amount" type="digit" value="{{paidAmount}}" bindinput="amount"/><view class="muted warning">实收金额与售价不一致时会记录差额，请确认线下收款无误。</view><button class="btn" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">确认收款并发卡</button></view>
